# Max the Golden Token Retrieval — demo tape. Regenerate: vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 880
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "goldenclaw"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "wakeup"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "max"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "fetch my monthly tokens"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
